<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><em id="id1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">ReMem</em>: Mutual Information-Aware Fine-tuning of Pretrained Vision Transformers for Effective Knowledge Distillation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
