<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Hyperparameter settings</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.2 Hyperparameter settings ‣ Appendix A Additional experiment setup details ‣ ReMem: Mutual Information-Aware Fine-tuning of Pretrained Vision Transformers for Effective Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, we list all hyperparameters employed in this paper as well as their choices.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
