(Top) Visualization of the most critical neurons in the <math id="A3.F13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10</annotation></semantics></math>-th MLP block. Here the model is a pretrained but not fine-tuned ViT-Small model. (Bottom) Image examples that are most influenced by the corresponding neurons. Here the downstream dataset is Caltech-101.
