<figure id="A3.F14" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2506.23041v1/feature-visualize-flowers.png" id="A3.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/93;" width="476" height="93" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>
(Top) Visualization of the most critical neurons in the <math id="A3.F14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10</annotation></semantics></math>-th MLP block. Here the model is a pretrained but not fine-tuned ViT-Base model. (Bottom) Image examples that are most influenced by the corresponding neurons. Here the downstream dataset is Flowers-102.
</figcaption>
